        !!! ATTENTION !!!
       only for supervisor
     X, Y, Z can be moved by
     X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- key
     or handwheel
     service tool changer
           (single arm)
************************************
 
#101  S to TC position
#102  Z to TC position put out
#103  Z to TC position put in
#104  Tool lock open
#105  Tool lock close
#106  Magazine to spindle
#107  Magazine to basic position
#108  Tool unclamping
#109  Tool clamping
#110  Magazine turn clockwise
#111  Magazine turn counterclockwise
#112  Magazine reference
#113  Delete spindle status (T0)
